OL,3,GNEWSABuilder's prison sentence
OL,4,Asuspended after appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA builder who took more than #200,000
OL,7,Ffor incomplete or poor quality work
OL,8,Fwhile his company was in debt has had
OL,9,Fhis prison sentence suspended at the
OL,10,FCourt of Appeal.
OL,12,FMichael Haslam, from Derby, was
OL,13,Fsentenced in July to two years and four
OL,14,Fmonths in prison, of which he was told
OL,15,Fhe would serve 40% before being
OL,16,Freleased on licence.
OL,18,FAt a hearing on Wednesday, Lady Justice
OL,19,FWhipple described it as "an unusual
OL,20,Fcase" because the judge sentencing the
OL,21,F74-year-old had suggested he would not
OL,22,Fgo to prison before he pleaded guilty.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
